<edge source="russia_europe_war::transport_logistics_capa" target="ai_global_rivalry::chip_supply_constraint" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Degradation in transport and logistics capacity (longer transit times, port congestion, fewer truck/rail movements) directly reduces timely delivery of wafers, tools and finished chips, increasing effective supply constraints, while improvements relieve those bottlenecks.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_europe_war</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_global_rivalry</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_europe_war::transport_logistics_capa" target="china_regional_power::supply_chain_shift_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Degradation of Eurasian transport and logistics capacity (blocked rail corridors, contested sea lanes, port disruptions) raises lead times and costs for China–Europe shipments, causing firms to accelerate reconfiguration and geographic diversification of supply chains away from vulnerable China‑dependent routes.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_europe_war</data>
  <data key="d39">china_regional_power</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_europe_war::transport_logistics_capa" target="us_iran_standoff::military_presence_level" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Degraded European transport and distribution capacity for energy forces rerouting and convoying of supplies along longer or more contested corridors, generating requests for naval/air escorts and forward basing that increase US and allied military deployments in the Middle East theater.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_europe_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_standoff</data>
</edge>
