  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">If markets increasingly expect prolonged disruptions to European energy supplies, China is likely to accelerate long‑term procurement and financing deals with Russian and regional suppliers, which in turn triggers elevated security reviews, investigations, and diplomatic scrutiny of those Chinese actors by Western and regional governments.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
