  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased use of emergency interventions (central bank liquidity facilities, market backstops, sovereign guarantees) directly supplies or guarantees short-term funding and collateral, easing scarcity and lowering measured stress in wholesale funding markets.</data>
