  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A cut in China's benchmark interest rate lowers borrowing costs for manufacturers and commodity traders, boosting Chinese industrial and inventory-driven oil and gas demand and exerting upward pressure on global (and European) energy prices within weeks.</data>
